zkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","color":"885544","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2025-12-03T17:42:35Z","updated_at":"2025-12-10T11:41:42Z","closed_at":"2025-12-10T11:21:32Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.6.dev5.official [f5918a9d3]\n\n### System information\n\nlinux\n\n### Issue description\n\nI haven’t tested this further, but I noticed that crashes occur after changing a 3D node (such as a CSG or MeshInstance) to a Control node. Regular 3D nodes do nothing when their type is changed. I’m not sure what might be causing this, but it seems like the editor simply can’t render it.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1e2f0269-8aca-496a-b69c-a9fe7f519bcd\n\nI also noticed that this doesn’t always happen. In the last example in the video, you can see that the error doesn’t occur, and it appeared only after saving the scene. I don’t know if saving affects it, although the previous examples show entirely new scenes without saving. Maybe it’s not the saving itself, but the fact that the scene was updated and became active for this error to appear.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nI tested this in my own project, but it also happens in an empty one. You just need to take a CSG or MeshInstance and convert it into a Control node, or do the same with its parent.","closed_by":{"login":"lyuma","id":39946030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTQ2MDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39946030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma","html_url":"https://github.com/lyuma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113518/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113518/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"duplicate","pinned_comment":null}